269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (Chaudhary Bansi Lal University \(CBLU\), Bhiwani, is a State University established by the Government of Haryana under Act No. 25 of 2014 and recognized by the UGC under Sections 2\(f\) and 12B. It is a teaching-cum-affiliating, multidisciplinary university established to expand access to quality higher education in the Bhiwani region. The University has grown rapidly, offering undergraduate, postgraduate, diploma and doctoral programmes, with a strong focus on research, skill development, industry interface, entrepreneurship, sports, community outreach and holistic student development. Its current priorities include knowledge creation, indigenous research, student welfare, multidisciplinary education, industry collaboration and contributing to socio-economic transformation and Atmanirbhar Bharat.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [46]
>>
endobj
