271 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (The All India Institute of Local Self-Government \(AIILSG\), established in 1926 and headquartered in Mumbai, is a premier government-recognized institution dedicated to strengthening urban governance and Urban Local Bodies \(ULBs\) across India. Operating through a vast pan-India network of over 54 regional centres, AIILSG has trained more than 1.5 million municipal officials, elected representatives, and urban professionals in key areas like urban planning, climate resilience, sanitation, and waste management. Furthermore, the institute serves as a vital technical and policy partner to national, state, and local governments, actively supporting major sustainable development initiatives such as the Smart Cities Mission, Swachh Bharat Mission, and AMRUT.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [48]
>>
endobj
